{"id":"4b42ccbebbab8162","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-genus.md","title":"Genus","display":"df-genus — Genus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-genus","aliases":["58-df-genus","Genus"],"display":"df-genus — Genus","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-surface.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-connected.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-genus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-genus</span><span>Genus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-genus — Genus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"07a09ca243e6c6a3\" href=\"?note=07a09ca243e6c6a3\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-surface.md\">../batch03/58-df-surface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71801f5b9407391a\" href=\"?note=71801f5b9407391a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-connected.md\">../batch10/58-df-connected.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,g,\\chi\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,g,\\chi\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{(-)}\">\\(\\tau_{(-)}\\)</span> 是固定的拓扑登记函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})\">\\(\\Sigma\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\Sigma=\\tau_{(-)}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\tau_\\Sigma=\\tau_{(-)}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\\)</span>。一元曲面兼容记号均在这个相同环境中解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 使用依赖文件中的定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boundaryless}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Boundaryless}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SurfaceEulerCharacteristic}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SurfaceEulerCharacteristic}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Genus}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Genus}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 在断言中仅对有限集取自然数基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}boundaryless}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Boundaryless}_S(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}boundaryless}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Boundaryless}_S(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}euler\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SurfaceEulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\ge3\\to\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in3\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\chi=|\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(0))|-|\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(1))|+|\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(2))|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}surface\\text{-}euler\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SurfaceEulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\ge3\\to\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in3\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\chi=|\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(0))|-|\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(1))|+|\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(2))|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}genus}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Genus}_S(\\Sigma,g)\\leftrightarrow\ng\\in\\omega\\land\\Sigma\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Boundaryless}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists o\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,o)\n\\land\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SurfaceEulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,\\Sigma)\\land\\chi=2-2g\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}genus}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Genus}_S(\\Sigma,g)\\leftrightarrow\ng\\in\\omega\\land\\Sigma\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Boundaryless}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists o\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrientedSurfaceAtlas}_S(\\Sigma,\\tau_\\Sigma,o)\n\\land\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SurfaceEulerCharacteristic}_S(\\chi,\\Sigma)\\land\\chi=2-2g\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Genus}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Genus}_S\\)</span> 在 Hypothesis 所固定的拓扑环境中解释，与书内单参数拓扑空间记号的用途一致；它不是一元的数值函数。</li>\n<li>采用不含边界的局部欧氏流形谓词，所以无需额外的自然语言 “boundaryless” 原语。</li>\n<li>Euler 示性数使用同一个指定拓扑上的有限二维胞腔分解，不把数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2-2g\">\\(2-2g\\)</span> 反过来当作缺失 Euler 谓词的定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Stillwell, Classical Topology and Combinatorial Group Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-surface.md","status":"resolved","id":"07a09ca243e6c6a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-surface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-connected.md","status":"resolved","id":"71801f5b9407391a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-connected.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.